</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="return"><para>BAD_FUNC_ARG Returned when siphash or key is NULL </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="return"><para>BAD_FUNC_ARG Returned when outSz is neither 8 nor 16</para>
</simplesect>
